  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 reached end of support on June 1st, 2026, and no longer receives updates, including security fixes. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Introduced Amazon SimpleDB export functionality enabling domain data export to S3 in JSON format. Added three new APIs StartDomainExport, GetExport, and ListExports via SimpleDBv2 service. Supports cross-region exports and KMS encryption.",
